      "text_raw": "The voltage gain at low\nfrequencies is now easily\nobtained. Note that this\ngain is high because cas-\ncodes are used. Gain boost-\ning could be applied to the\ncascodes M4 and M8 to\nincrease the gain even\nfurther.\nThe bandwidth is created\nat the same output node.\nThe GBW is the product. It\nis exactly the same as for\na single-transistor amplifier.\nOf course, the input trans-\nconcuctance is smaller here,\nas only half of the current\nflows in the input stage.\nWhat is the advantage of this folded OTA? It consumes twice the current of a telescopic\ncascode stage!",
